    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyler receives a sudden location from his missing brother\u2019s phone.<br>It leads him to a remote, fog-covered island \u2014 a place of cults, silence, and things best left forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He thought he came to rescue.<br>Instead, he walked into a nightmare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cinematic Psychological Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bleak Haven is a survival horror game in which you'll explore abandoned villages, crypts, ruins, and underground chambers \u2014 each hiding twisted secrets and fragments of a lost past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/770ea4bcdc2bae380f5b65af280c95c4.poster.avif?t=1753704302\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/770ea4bcdc2bae380f5b65af280c95c4.webm?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/770ea4bcdc2bae380f5b65af280c95c4.mp4?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raw, Violent Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against grotesque, humanoid abominations using blunt melee weapons and limited firearms.<br>Combat is fast, physical, and lethal.<br>Finishers allow you to execute enemies when caught off guard or weakened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/ceb07518de77ccdba67f8e4041ee0f90.poster.avif?t=1753704302\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/ceb07518de77ccdba67f8e4041ee0f90.webm?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/ceb07518de77ccdba67f8e4041ee0f90.mp4?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle Solving and Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles, uncover strange mechanisms, and investigate symbols and documents left behind by the cult and other survivors.<br>Progress through layered locations filled with traps, locked paths, and disturbing relics of rituals gone wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/5c334d57078c8dd96bf35b4e14e2beb6.poster.avif?t=1753704302\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/5c334d57078c8dd96bf35b4e14e2beb6.webm?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/5c334d57078c8dd96bf35b4e14e2beb6.mp4?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in Unreal Engine 5, Bleak Haven features performance-captured cutscenes, immersive voice acting, and a haunting atmosphere.<br>The story blends seamlessly into gameplay for a grounded, emotionally heavy experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/7f9dd709a74e08a31090f0e144ba55c2.poster.avif?t=1753704302\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/7f9dd709a74e08a31090f0e144ba55c2.webm?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/7f9dd709a74e08a31090f0e144ba55c2.mp4?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyler receives a sudden location from his missing brother\u2019s phone.<br>It leads him to a remote, fog-covered island \u2014 a place of cults, silence, and things best left forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He thought he came to rescue.<br>Instead, he walked into a nightmare.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cinematic Psychological Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bleak Haven is a survival horror game in which you'll explore abandoned villages, crypts, ruins, and underground chambers \u2014 each hiding twisted secrets and fragments of a lost past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/770ea4bcdc2bae380f5b65af280c95c4.poster.avif?t=1753704302\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/770ea4bcdc2bae380f5b65af280c95c4.webm?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/770ea4bcdc2bae380f5b65af280c95c4.mp4?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raw, Violent Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against grotesque, humanoid abominations using blunt melee weapons and limited firearms.<br>Combat is fast, physical, and lethal.<br>Finishers allow you to execute enemies when caught off guard or weakened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/ceb07518de77ccdba67f8e4041ee0f90.poster.avif?t=1753704302\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/ceb07518de77ccdba67f8e4041ee0f90.webm?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/ceb07518de77ccdba67f8e4041ee0f90.mp4?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle Solving and Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles, uncover strange mechanisms, and investigate symbols and documents left behind by the cult and other survivors.<br>Progress through layered locations filled with traps, locked paths, and disturbing relics of rituals gone wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/5c334d57078c8dd96bf35b4e14e2beb6.poster.avif?t=1753704302\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/5c334d57078c8dd96bf35b4e14e2beb6.webm?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/5c334d57078c8dd96bf35b4e14e2beb6.mp4?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in Unreal Engine 5, Bleak Haven features performance-captured cutscenes, immersive voice acting, and a haunting atmosphere.<br>The story blends seamlessly into gameplay for a grounded, emotionally heavy experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/7f9dd709a74e08a31090f0e144ba55c2.poster.avif?t=1753704302\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/7f9dd709a74e08a31090f0e144ba55c2.webm?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566840/extras/7f9dd709a74e08a31090f0e144ba55c2.mp4?t=1753704302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Bleak Haven is a cinematic survival horror where faith is twisted, every shot matters, and survival hangs on what you can build. Explore haunted ruins, abandoned villages, and face a cult preparing the world for a god no one should ever witness.",
